Subject: [PATCH 17/29] Vehicles (holtburger fork): Dericost clamps, Aux reason
 codes, IFF/power gating, RadarStation stow, security & lifecycle QC fixes

Fix QC defects across Vehicles and Deployables:
- Continent-aware Dericost BodyEdgeMin..BodyEdgeMax clamping in VehicleManager, PalletJackDeployable, and VehicleBailout, plus Dericost cell support in VehicleTerrain.
- Populate VehicleEventMsg.Aux reason codes (0..7) for SideliftRefused and PalletJackEvent matching client tables; emit PalletJackEvent (25) on pallet jack failures.
- Fix IsoContainerDeployable.ComputeUnpackSpawnLocation AC compass heading signs and fallback YawOnly rotation.
- Use GlobalPosition in DeployableBase.SetStowed(false) for MicroGrid center and containment; clear Powered|InFluxRange on FluxPod stow and FluxPod.Destroy() (plus !Grid.Pod.IsDestroyed and DeployableManager.Tick stale-grid cleanup).
- Add CreateStateMsg/BroadcastState/Despawn and 1 Hz tick broadcast for RadarStation (4000002) stow/active transitions, and gate TryUnpackSlot(4000002) on DeployableManager.TryEnterWorld with slot/GUID rollback on failure.
- Enforce CapPilot, !IsDead (null-safe), !Teleporting, !IsSeated (keeping same-tractor Seat-0 pilot Hitch/Unhitch), and AccessLevel.Developer on container Action=3 Load.
- Enforce MicroGrid IsPowered gating across MissileTurret, MortarTurret, GroundRadar, and LaserTurret; wire RadarIff standing and Hostile-only turret cueing.
- Fix Vehicle.IsEmpty idle-parked despawn with passengers, TryHitchTrailer non-idle sidelifter guard, straddling landblock-unload drop-to-terrain (preserving straddling stowed pallet jack XY), TryPackDeployable destroyed/packed guard, and stowed pallet jack late-observer sync.

Verified via canonical Debug build & tests: 336/336 Vehicles tests and 13/13 Landblock tests pass; sync-ace-fixtures.sh --check passes.
